Tool response:
Tool: assign_prep_tasks
Description: Assign multiple prep tasks to a specific shift assignment.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "shift_assignment_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Shift Assignment Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "tasks": {
          "items": {
            "properties": {
              "description": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "Description"
              }
            },
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "description"
            ],
            "title": "PrepTaskCreate"
          },
          "type": "array",
          "title": "Tasks"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "shift_assignment_id",
        "tasks"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: log_deviation
Description: Record a deviation for a given prep task with a description.
The logged_by_user_id is inferred from the authenticated user.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "prep_task_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Prep Task Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Description"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "prep_task_id",
        "description"
      ]
    }
